url: "https://github.com/Albertito-AI/tallystick"
abstract: "A research workbench for sports fact provenance, settlement replay and market-rule checks using synthetic data. It records fictional corrections and exports verifiable recorder evidence; it authenticates no real sporting fact and performs no financial settlement."
